<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling continued to gain against the dollar and pound on Wednesday, exchanging at a commercial mean rate of 595.0692 to the dollar compared to Tuesday's 595.6830, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Against sterling, the shilling exchanged for 980.0820, up from Tuesday's mean of 984.0713 shillings.</p>
</text>
